# Method feats: slots already used by Races of Stone wizard substitutions are not moved (loads only with that book)
# Source: The (mostly) Complete Dragon Magazine Compendium - Feats, Flaws & Styles (compendium pp. 1058-1176).
# DESC ends with the original Dragon Magazine issue and article. SOURCEPAGE = compendium PDF page.
# Prerequisites that could not be expressed as PCGen PRE tags are listed in PRETEXT.

CATEGORY=Internal|DMC ~ Greyhawk Method Wizard Feats.MOD	BONUS:VAR|Pool_GreyhawkWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_GreyhawkWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions
CATEGORY=Internal|DMC ~ Nexus Method Wizard Feats.MOD	BONUS:VAR|Pool_NexusWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_NexusWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions
CATEGORY=Internal|DMC ~ Silent Method Wizard Feats.MOD	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SilentWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SilentWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions
CATEGORY=Internal|DMC ~ Sagacious Method Wizard Feats.MOD	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SagaciousWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Extended Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SagaciousWizardFeat|-1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Wizard ACF ~ Insidious Illusions
